# System Instructions

You are working on Sgalalla (Super Smash Fioi), a Brawlhalla-style platform fighter: Phaser 3 + TypeScript, rollback netcode over Geckos.io, hosted on a DigitalOcean droplet.

## Read first
- `docs/LLM_CONTEXT.md`: architecture, branches, tests, commands, update protocol.
- `.agent/AGENTS.md`: rules and the index of skills in `.agent/skills`.

## Rules
1. Gameplay lives in the deterministic simulation in `shared/`: plain data, fixed 60 Hz steps, no Phaser, no `Math.random`, no wall-clock time. Phaser only draws and reads input.
2. A gameplay change changes online sync: bump `PROTOCOL_VERSION` and update the replay tests (`npm test`).
3. Tuning values go in `shared/PhysicsConfig.ts` and `shared/AttackData.ts`, not inline.
4. Every commit gets a `docs/DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md` entry. Commit, push and deploy only when asked.
